sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant L as Leader
    participant F1 as Follower 1
    participant F2 as Follower 2
    Cl->>L: write
    L->>L: append to its log, uncommitted
    par replicate
        L->>F1: AppendEntries
        L->>F2: AppendEntries
    end
    F1-->>L: ack
    Note over L: a majority has it — now it is committed
    L-->>Cl: success
    F2-->>L: late ack
    alt leader dies
        F1->>F1: election timeout, become candidate
        F1->>F2: RequestVote
        F2-->>F1: vote
        Note over F1: only a node with an up-to-date log can win, so committed writes survive
    end
